<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.6.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02422</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.6.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>2a859e72-4e2a-48b8-9ee7-a0660412af24</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For each equation in questions 1 – 5, identify the values of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) that you would substitute into the quadratic formula to solve the equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(3x^2+8x+4=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 3</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 8</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 4</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(2x^2−5x+2=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 2</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -5</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 2</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(-9x^2+13x−1=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -9</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 13</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(x^2+x−11=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -11</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(-x^2+16x+64=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 16</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 64</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>For each equation, use the quadratic formula to solve the equation, then choose the correct <emphasis>two </emphasis>solutions for \(x\). </item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(x^2+9x+20=0\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item> 4 </item>
  <item> -4 </item>
  <item> -5 </item>
  <item> 5 </item>
  <item> 1 </item>
  <item> 9 </item>
  <item> 20 </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -4, -5</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(x^2−10x+21=0\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item> 3 </item>
  <item> -7 </item>
  <item> 21 </item>
  <item> -10 </item>
  <item> 1 </item>
  <item> -4 </item>
  <item> 7 </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 3, 7</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(3x^2−5x+1=0\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(\frac{13}{6}+\frac{\sqrt{5}}{6}\)</item>
  <item> -1 </item>
  <item>\(\frac{5}{6}-\frac{\sqrt{13}}{6}\)</item>
  <item>\(\frac{13}{6}-\frac{\sqrt{5}}{6}\)</item>
  <item>\(-\frac{18}{6}-3\)</item>
  <item>\(\frac{5}{6}+\frac{\sqrt{13}}{6}\)</item>
  <item>\(\frac{18}{6}-3\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>\(\frac{5}{6}+\frac{\sqrt{13}}{6}\), \(\frac{5}{6}-\frac{\sqrt{13}}{6}\)</para>
<para>For each equation for questions 7 – 12, identify the values of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) that you would substitute into the quadratic formula to solve the equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(x^2+9x+18=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 9</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 18</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4x^2−3x+11=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>a. What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 4</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -3</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 11</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(81−x+5x^2=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 5</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 81</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(45x^2+3x=\frac{1}{3}\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 45</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 3</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(-\frac{1}{3}\)</item>
  <item> \(\frac{1}{3}\)</item>
  <item> 1 </item>
  <item> 0 </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>\(-\frac{1}{3}\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="11" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(121=x^2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 1</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 0</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -121</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="12" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(7x+14x^2=42\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(a\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 14</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(b\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 7</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the value of \(c\)?</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -42</para></section>
</content>
</document>
